{
  "title": "Yellowed Silky Syrian Lamb Stew",
  "description": "A hearty and flavorful diabetic-friendly stew featuring lamb, kombu, and a nimono-simmer, perfect for a midnight craving. This dish is a unique blend of Syrian and Japanese influences.",
